  nonce: e6ab  # e6ab
  message: "Satisfied in PR #1702 (dev ac651f01d5). zig.py finds a call's enclosing function with symbol_declared_by over symbols_at(this file's symbols) instead of resolver.lookup(qualified_name). Behavioral evidence: test_zig.py::TestZigEnclosingByPosition — a.zig and b.zig each define run() calling a different helper; every calls edge's src is now in the same file as its dst (before the fix: a.zig's run -> b.zig's helper, observed on the filed shape); two structs' same-named go() methods in one file keep their own calls."  # e6ab
